  "source": "## Semantics: V1, C1, K1, A1, A2, M0\ngrammar ConformanceMergeLaws version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Duplicate capture keys merge right-biased; text beside a map is dropped.\n  main = ( \"a\" as k ) ( \"b\" as k ) \"tail\"\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    shape \"abtail\" { k: \"b\" }\n  }\n}\n",
